  dialogText: {fileID: 1988102483}
  choice1Text: {fileID: 2052835529}
  choice2Text: {fileID: 901461817}
  messages:
  - Authorities arrived through some neighbours who called the police and arrested
    you at the crime szene.
  - 'Interrogator: So, do you know why we arrested you? Were you the killer or the
    weird clown uncle?'
  choice1Result: 'Definetly me '
  choice1ExtraMessages:
  - 'Interrogator: YOU GO TO PRISONNN'
  choice2Result: I am Innocent, its the weird uncle.
  choice2ExtraMessages:
  - Ok got it bro, we found the corpse on ballons and the knife in his shoes so we
    believe you. Have a nice day :-)
  typingSpeed: 0.05
